{"text": "That night the Student went to bed and fell asleep, thinking of his love. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> When the moon shone in the sky, the Nightingale flew to the rose tree and pressed her breast against the thorn. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> All night long she sang, and the cold white moon leaned down and listened. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She sang first of the love that is born in the heart of a boy and a girl. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> On the top of the tree a lovely rose began to bloom, but it was pale like the mist over the river. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Press closer, little Nightingale, cried the tree, or the day will come before the rose is finished. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> So she pressed closer, and her song grew louder and louder. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> A soft pink came into the leaves of the rose, but its heart was still white. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> At last the thorn touched her heart, and she felt a sharp pain. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She sang of the love that never dies, and the rose became deep red like the morning sky. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then her voice grew weak, and her little wings began to beat. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Look, the rose is finished, cried the tree, but the Nightingale lay dead in the long grass.", "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "h", "a", "t", " ", "n", "i", "g", "h", "t", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "S", "t", "u", "d", "e", "n", "t", " ", "w", "e", "n", "t", " ", "t", "o", " ", "b", "e", "d", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "f", "e", "l", "l", " ", "a", "s", "l", "e", "e", "p", ",", " ", "t", "h", "i", "n", "k", "i", "n", "g", " ", "o", "f", " ", "h", "i", "s", " ", "l", "o", "v", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "W", "h", "e", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "m", "o", "o", "n", " ", "s", "h", "o", "n", "e", " ", "i", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "s", "k", "y", ",", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "N", "i", "g", "h", "t", "i", "n", "g", "a", "l", "e", 